You load advanced grenades into your launcher.

Incendiary Grenade: Deals fire damage over 3 turns, increasing damage taken by [2%, 9%, 14%, 18%, 21% (TL1-5)].

Chemical Grenade: Deals acid damage and slows targets by [7%, 15%, 20%, 23%, 26% (TL1-5)] for 3 turns.

Shock Grenade: Deals lightning damage and shocks targets for [3, 3, 4, 5, 5 (TL1-5)] turns, reducing stun and pin resistance by 50%.

In addition, your turrets now explode when destroyed, dealing [184, 248, 298, 340, 377 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] physical damage to enemies in radius 3.

You can only choose a single type of grenade at a time.
